Keluarga dan Rumah &lt;NAMA&gt;

Saya akan menulis tentang keluarga &lt;NAMA&gt; dan rumah dia. &lt;NAMA&gt; adalah mahasiswa APM tahun kedua. Dia lahir dan besar di <segment id='1' features='eror;ejaan;ejhrf' state='active'>Sidoarja</segment>. Kota itu <segment id='2' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-preposisi;prep0' state='active'>terkenal udang</segment> dan dekat Surabaya. Sekarang dia tinggal di daerah Mochigahama. Hobi dia <segment id='4' features='eror;ejaan;ejhrf' state='active'>olaharaga</segment>, <segment id='5' features='eror;leksikal;kata;ktas' state='active'>tennis</segment> <segment id='3' features='eror;ejaan;ejtb' state='active'>meja dan</segment> binaraga. Dia <segment id='7' features='eror;leksikal;kata;vrbs' state='active'><segment id='6' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-verba;vrbafx' state='active' parent='7'>main</segment></segment> binaraga seminggu 5 <segment id='8' features='eror;leksikal;kata;noms' state='active'>hari</segment> di <segment id='38' features='eror;leksikal;kata;ktas' state='active'>gym</segment> di dekat rumah dia. Dia suka makanan <segment id='9' features='eror;ejaan;ejtb' state='active'><segment id='10' features='eror;gramatikal;konjungsi;konj0' state='active' parent='9'>Indonesia, dia</segment></segment> paling suka bebek goreng.

Keluarga dia ada dua orang, <segment id='39' features='eror;ejaan;ejk' state='active'>Ibu</segment> dia dan dia. Ibunya bernama &lt;NAMA&gt;. Dia <segment id='11' features='eror;leksikal;kata;ktinf' state='active'>aslinya</segment> <segment id='14' features='eror;ejaan;ejtb' state='active'><segment id='12' features='eror;ejaan;ejk' state='active' parent='14'><segment id='13' features='eror;ejaan;ejhrf' state='active' parent='12'>sidoarja</segment></segment>, <segment id='15' features='eror;leksikal;kata;konjs' state='active' parent='14'>jadi</segment></segment> <segment id='16' features='eror;gramatikal;konjungsi;konj0' state='active'>bekerja karyawan</segment> swasta. Ibu dia <segment id='17' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-verba;vrbx' state='active'>punya</segment> 4 bersaudara dan <segment id='40' features='eror;gramatikal;kalimat;kalsub' state='active'>anak <segment id='18' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-nomina;nomafx' state='active' parent='40'>keketiga</segment></segment>. Ayah dia <segment id='19' features='eror;ejaan;ejhrf' state='active'>mehingal</segment> tahun 2021. Ayah dia <segment id='20' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-verba;vrbx' state='active'>punya</segment> 8 bersaudara dan <segment id='41' features='eror;gramatikal;kalimat;kalsub' state='active'>anak keempat</segment>. Meraka punya 4 kucing. Namanya Sapi dan Gray, <segment id='21' features='eror;leksikal;kata;konjs' state='active'>lalu</segment> <segment id='22' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-nomina;urtfn' state='active'>lain 2 kucing</segment> tidak ada nama. <segment id='23' features='eror;gramatikal;konjungsi;konjx' state='active'>Lalu</segment> dia punya 3 sepupu dari <segment id='42' features='eror;ejaan;ejk' state='active'>Ibu</segment> dia dan 10 sepupu dari ayah dia.

<segment id='24' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-preposisi;prep0' state='active'>Rumah dia</segment> ada halaman dan garasi. Di <segment id='25' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-nomina;nom0' state='active'>halaman dia</segment> ada banyak <segment id='43' features='eror;leksikal;kata;noms' state='active'>tumbuhan</segment> hias dan <segment id='44' features='eror;ejaan;ejtb' state='active'>bunga. <segment id='45' features='eror;ejaan;ejk' state='active' parent='44'>Misalnya</segment></segment> <segment id='26' features='eror;ejaan;ejk' state='active'>Anggrek</segment> warna putih. <segment id='27' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-nomina;nom0' state='active'>Halaman dia</segment> tidak luas <segment id='28' features='eror;leksikal;kata;ktinf' state='active'>tapi</segment> banyak <segment id='30' features='eror;ejaan;ejhrf' state='active'>memdapakan</segment> sinar matahari <segment id='47' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-nomina;nom0' state='active'>dan <segment id='46' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-verba;vrb0' state='active'><segment id='29' features='eror;ejaan;ejhrf' state='active' parent='46'>parking</segment></segment> motor</segment>. <segment id='48' features='eror;leksikal;kata;ktvar' state='active'>Rumah dia <segment id='33' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-verba;vrbafx' state='active' parent='48'>warna</segment> kuning dan hijau muda. <segment id='31' features='eror;gramatikal;kalimat;kalsub' state='active' parent='48'>Berlantai satu</segment>. <segment id='32' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-preposisi;prep0' state='active' parent='48'>Rumah dia</segment> tidak ada pembantu. Di rumah dia ada dua kamar tidur dan dua kamar mandi.</segment>

Wawancara <segment id='34' features='eror;ejaan;ejhrf' state='active'>degan</segment> dia <segment id='35' features='eror;ejaan;ejtb' state='active'>menyenangkan, karena</segment> dia sangat ramah <segment id='36' features='eror;leksikal;kata;ktinf' state='active'>waktu</segment> saya tidak tahu kosakata. <segment id='37' features='eror;leksikal;kata;konjs' state='active'>Lalu</segment> dia merekomendasikan tempat-tempat di Indonesia. Saya ingin pergi ke Indonesia.    </body>
